---
const milestones = [
  { year: '1995', title: 'The Foundation', desc: 'Rudra Green Ship Recycling is founded in Bhavnagar as Hari Krishna Steel Corporation.' },
  { year: '2002–2004', title: 'A Home on the Shore', desc: 'The company establishes its operational base at the Alang-Sosiya Ship Recycling Yard.' },
  { year: '2003', title: 'Factory Licence', desc: 'The factory licence for yard operations is secured.' },
  { year: '2009', title: 'GMB Agreement Formalised', desc: 'A formal agreement with the Gujarat Maritime Board is put in place.' },
  { year: '2016', title: 'First Wave of International Certifications', desc: 'The company earns its first set of internationally recognized certifications.' },
  { year: '2017', title: 'HKC Green Yard', desc: 'The yard is certified as HKC-compliant.' },
  { year: '2018', title: 'A New Name', desc: 'The company is renamed Rudra Green Ship Recycling Private Limited.' },
  { year: '2018', title: 'GEPIL Membership', desc: 'The company joins GEPIL as a member.' },
  { year: '2019', title: 'GPCB Name Transition', desc: 'The name change is formally reflected with the Gujarat Pollution Control Board.' },
  { year: '2020', title: 'ISO 45001:2018 Certification', desc: 'Occupational Health & Safety management certification is achieved.' },
]
---

<section class="relative bg-paper py-24 lg:py-32 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="hidden xl:block absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.03] pointer-events-none"
    style="background-image: linear-gradient(#0E2142 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, #0E2142 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 64px 64px;">
  </div>

  <div class="relative max-w-[1800px] mx-auto px-6 sm:px-10 xl:px-16 2xl:px-20">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[0.55fr_1fr] gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-end mb-16 lg:mb-20">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
          <span class="w-8 h-px bg-rust-500"></span>
          <p class="eyebrow text-rust-500">Milestones</p>
        </div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-semibold text-3xl lg:text-4xl xl:text-[2.75rem] text-navy-950 leading-[1.1]">
          A record, kept as it grows.
        </h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-stone-600 text-base lg:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
        Key dates in the group's history, maintained as an ongoing register rather than
        a fixed narrative — updated as new milestones are confirmed.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-4xl border-t border-stone-300">
      {milestones.map((m, i) => (
        <div class="group flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline gap-2 sm:gap-8 py-8 border-b border-stone-300 transition-colors hover:bg-white/60 px-3 -mx-3">
          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-stone-400 w-10 shrink-0">{String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
          <span class="font-display font-semibold text-2xl xl:text-3xl text-navy-950 w-full sm:w-32 shrink-0">{m.year}</span>
          <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
            <p class="font-medium text-navy-900 mb-1.5">{m.title}</p>
            <p class="text-stone-600 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-xl">{m.desc}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-4xl mt-8 flex items-center gap-4 border border-stone-300 bg-white px-6 py-5">
      <span class="flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-sage-600/10 border border-sage-600/30 shrink-0">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" class="text-sage-600"><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4M12 2l7 3v6c0 5-3.4 8.7-7 10-3.6-1.3-7-5-7-10V5l7-3z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      </span>
      <div>
        <p class="font-semibold text-navy-950 text-sm">70+ ships recycled</p>
        <p class="text-stone-500 text-xs mt-0.5">Hundreds of thousands of LDT of material responsibly recovered and returned to India's productive economy.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="max-w-4xl mt-6 text-xs text-stone-500 leading-relaxed">
      Candidates worth confirming for this register: HKC compliance date, ISO/OHSAS
      certification dates, the year ship recycling operations began at Alang, and the
      years the cement, ACC blocks, and industrial pipes verticals launched.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>